{
  "_comment": [
    "Template only, and named so Codex cannot mistake it for the real thing.",
    "`agentgit install` writes spine.json beside it, with the NODE, NODE_FLAGS and",
    "DAEMON placeholders resolved to this machine.",
    "",
    "This file exists because a hook handler's command is exactly \"node plus one",
    "script\": the daemon's entry point cannot be a third argument on that command",
    "line without making 'every handler names one script' either false or weaker.",
    "So spine.mjs reads where the daemon lives from here, beside itself, instead.",
    "",
    "NODE_FLAGS is resolved at install time rather than hard-coded because Node only",
    "strips TypeScript types unflagged from major 23 onward, and the daemon entry is",
    "TypeScript. Node < 23 needs --experimental-strip-types, and the plugin has to",
    "work on the Node the user already has.",
    "",
    "spine.json is gitignored for the same reason hooks.json is: it holds absolute",
    "paths from one machine, and committing it would ship them to another."
  ],
  "node": "{{NODE}}",
  "daemon": "{{DAEMON}}",
  "flags": [{{NODE_FLAGS}}]
}
